# The staged Conversation Agent contract SDK is a committed BUILD INPUT, not a
# build output (KIM-492 WP-E15). The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.jar, which
# is right for everything a build produces and wrong for this one: the jar and
# its .fingerprint sidecar have to travel together in source control or the
# drift check has nothing to check against. See gradle.properties#caContractsVersion.
!libs/*.jar
